<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I have to go home.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> says suddenly. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Been fun hanging out with you, but I have to be back a few hours before bedtime or I’ll get in trouble. I’ll see you later though.”</span> You raise an eyebrow at this, not at him having to leave, as it is getting pretty late, but his lack of energy in explaining to you that he has to go. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> would normally be sighing and proclaiming that you’ll have even more fun next time, but at the moment <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> seems bored and tired as he walks off with a wave. <span style="color:LightCoral">Guess he wasn’t really enjoying himself.</span><br>
